use firn/tags

hyperfine is a Module
hyperfine is tagged cli-tools

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.hyperfine.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.hyperfine]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."hyperfine"."enable": enable "hyperfine command benchmarking"
